rs will stand  with you shoulder to shoulder as we have  stood together throughout history  tonight we are all Parisians and as the  old motto of this resilient city says  and does Parisians have painted across  the social media in recent days flick to  a neck murga tour buffeted but not sunk  we will not let our sorrow for the loss  of life overcome us we will not lose  sight of all the good that we are  working together to do we will not  change our course or cancel our plans  including our plans to come together in  Paris later this month for the UN  climate conference  and President Obama told me today how  much he looks forward being here being  part of that important moment ultimately  we will defeat dash and all who share  their despicable ideology and we are on  the course to do so we will continue  also the show compassion to those who  seek refuge from the violence that the  terrorists and gender we will fight to  ensure that the world that our children  inherit is richer in love and shorter on  hate we will work to bring like knowing  me Gonzalez a beautiful shining light to  areas places that are couched in  darkness that's our responsibility  that's our duty and we will do our duty  side by side and we will prevail new van  caval dash a tu sukhi potash some  ideology meet Prasad a new continued LOL  mokh Raider compassion or ver Sookie  shesh refuge free on idea low social a  dar lative of east new new back home of  Lycia nozipho a monkey saw a blue leash  damu my complete then they come no Amy  Gonzalez news illuminare own late  enabler damn man ii thik hai o de soleil  sinatra d'ivoire a news alone larceny  ensemble a new news on softie ha thank  our next I beaucoup de ella vive la  France
 

